{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0085","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":7,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":112,"expected_output":"screening-0085.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1856","source_sha256":"9e93e7f69939997bfebea32f12df5f29e09094f18b545ce397052baf33e5f105","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در جعبه‌ای ۵ مهرهٔ زرد، ۴ مهرهٔ آبی و ۱ مهرهٔ قرمز موجود است. به تصادف سه مهره از جعبه خارج می‌کنیم، با چه احتمالی حداقل یک مهره زرد است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۵۶","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{11}{12}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.3962}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از روش متمم استفاده می‌کنیم.\\n$P(\\text{حداقل یک زرد}) = 1 - P(\\text{زرد نباشد}) = 1 - \\frac{\\binom{5}{3}}{\\binom{10}{3}} = 1 - \\frac{10}{120} = 1 - \\frac{1}{12} = \\frac{11}{12}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"f5c22923fa8bab7123637b2cb55c14abccd33dc2a464ce23909c1bf4380f1a17","bytes":90},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"88e0a79cdd2d517f8b8668e3adcb1a5a78bf16b23237b8d1b101b8e4f2a8c14a","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"88e0a79cdd2d517f8b8668e3adcb1a5a78bf16b23237b8d1b101b8e4f2a8c14a","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"f192a6d63a59f588196db695d669623400bf24e690ebeaed66e0b51cca4462e6","bytes":68},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1856/stem_1.webp","sha256":"00a16349018093e8d61ddf2e8a10b7fbbea0753eadf950d6b133f3e90765da7e","bytes":2052}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1856,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1857","source_sha256":"3ae8190b7429495b1bb8d92f46c39e58ddb803bab57179308e1faae790936b53","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۶ کارت با شماره‌های ۱ تا ۶ به طوری که شماره‌های آن‌ها مشخص نیست بر روی میز قرار دارند. سه کارت را به ترتیب برمی‌گردانیم، با چه احتمالی کارت اول و سوم شماره‌های زوج هستند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۵۷","aspect_ratio":0.0902}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5957}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6304}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6304}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{10}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.25}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. خواهیم داشت:\\n$n(A) = \\frac{3}{\\text{زوج}} \\times \\frac{3}{\\text{زوج}} \\times \\frac{2}{\\text{فرد}} + \\frac{3}{\\text{زوج}} \\times \\frac{2}{\\text{زوج}} \\times \\frac{1}{\\text{زوج}} = 18 + 6 = 24$\\nبنابراین:\\n$P(A) = \\frac{24}{6 \\times 5 \\times 4} = \\frac{1}{5}$\\nروش دوم: با کارت دوم کاری نداریم.\\n$P(A) = \\frac{3 \\times 2}{6 \\times 5} = \\frac{1}{5}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"efd442ff199f257124e44deb1ed652c63ab57f50827e6c45b238d20708faf237","bytes":428},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"abfaad289275315376b957dd1ee9ade6ddbd87847e695dfa24a772540dbeb0df","bytes":572},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"2133ed95ac7a6d783d56e5bd01238ce1e0ec509f7b8d8af44b271a32cc4ccb03","bytes":958},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ef779055c3574741718d47ad9001585ac803765169eecc03495fd0929ba15d25","bytes":68},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1857/stem_1.webp","sha256":"b0cf700401f1a28a04c427163a9b1bb83014da468aa20cb56994a4fca9e4d2bd","bytes":8718}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1857,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1858","source_sha256":"0888b97f5030eca8032e23defe26a1750d79b47fd659adb3e79003228303bc3f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در کیسه‌ای ۴ مهرهٔ آبی و تعدادی مهرهٔ قرمز موجود است. اگر یک مهرهٔ آبی را خارج کرده و به جای آن یک مهرهٔ قرمز اضافه کنیم، احتمال آن که از جعبه یک مهرهٔ قرمز خارج شود $\\frac{1}{10}$ افزایش می‌یابد. تعداد مهره‌های قرمز اولیه کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۵۸","aspect_ratio":0.0902}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۴"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.1915}],[{"type":"text","text":"۵"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"۶"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"۷"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.9333}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تعداد مهره‌های قرمز اولیه را $k$ در نظر می‌گیریم. پیشامد آن‌که در حالت اول مهره قرمز خارج شود را $A$ و پیشامد آن‌که بعد از تغییر مهره‌ها، مهره قرمز خارج شود را $B$ می‌نامیم.\\n$P(A) = \\frac{k}{k + 4}$\\n$P(B) = \\frac{k + 1}{k + 4}$\\n$P(B) - P(A) = \\frac{1}{10} \\Rightarrow \\frac{k + 1}{k + 4} - \\frac{k}{k + 4} = \\frac{1}{k + 4} = \\frac{1}{10} \\Rightarrow k + 4 = 10 \\Rightarrow k = 6$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"924e17de85c13f3ce3cdf1ad5a35ea2696c5ee5ee42d4563303dd07fe4db01fe","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"caf16aa357a9fefa9934e9a12c0ed79d16d6753cfb6ec7404d6bbad787d93570","bytes":184},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"16e1dd31a1980638437bdec02a491885c29aa7d5a16a78cf29dbf2ade87585d2","bytes":216},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"44e452f73c66df29ad6128cf0a214e11ac61efb3c3d8a44d6e686c3c221b7d0e","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1858/stem_1.webp","sha256":"e6176598b4459e2c8e1c921a23cda4ebcf019c54d725eb649783a8c3e1c66975","bytes":7744}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1858,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1859","source_sha256":"882f55e1b04b9fcc4fb9fd0acf9e6231b574422c691523fffce73486ac926ef2","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در جعبه‌ای ۶ لامپ سالم و ۳ لامپ معیوب وجود دارد. سه لامپ از جعبه خارج می‌کنیم، با کدام احتمال حداکثر ۱ لامپ معیوب است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۵۹","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{15}{28}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.2542}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{61}{84}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2542}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{65}{84}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"احتمال آن را می‌یابیم که یا ۱ لامپ و یا صفر لامپ معیوب باشد.\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{\\binom{3}{1} \\binom{6}{2} + \\binom{3}{0} \\binom{6}{3}}{\\binom{9}{3}} = \\frac{45 + 20}{84} = \\frac{65}{84}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"daec54457e7d17a9800c0812ff1a7fe93c1d39923bb7696f7d6b57acee746faf","bytes":628},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"37f0bdee6f21fe4fa136b53d501a8b6c8aedbb63711b20b15d0ac04848cc5a7d","bytes":1120},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"a5a2d0acf9f363a2c8273aa71a2c6efbead8a62a32a11718d0177e9a435d564c","bytes":1030},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"51e1c630609d014b01b179acd3b6f722c05ab8558ba11b4dcb7d85eb566c8c00","bytes":664},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1859/stem_1.webp","sha256":"6ed9466a62f5deab9d1e923ebb1aa40c85fc70c6d7e0aeba6fbc4141a39d8e52","bytes":4040}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1859,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1860","source_sha256":"e1aa1bf14fb1dd530a4d8014966827aee6880294ebeadbce4d8e27bc20350d14","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در جعبه‌ای ۵ مهرهٔ قرمز، ۳ مهرهٔ آبی و ۲ مهرهٔ سفید موجود است. دو مهره متوالیاً و به تصادف از جعبه خارج می‌کنیم، با کدام احتمال مهرهٔ اول قرمز و مهرهٔ دوم آبی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۰","aspect_ratio":0.0902}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.2542}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2542}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.2542}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{12}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.2542}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به این‌که ترتیب انتخاب مهره‌ها مهم است، احتمال را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{5 \\times 3}{10 \\times 9} = \\frac{1}{6}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"eddf2d223509fcc72daf55de507041ff8f95447ca8102cbcc75cd7a2343aeab2","bytes":390},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e5381b4bb7caa57ca6ae40d2c65f9db1b768f699c6abfa331568b158f2165bb9","bytes":1026},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"bf654c9ed92c1f314dd80f5ecf9895e658ed19d2d777a7490b3e4384e98ca4f6","bytes":1104},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"0ab70237eaa12ad6b25019a1f91cacf438161da432bfb5b159f10fabc1219f84","bytes":1650},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1860/stem_1.webp","sha256":"fb712926423b71ca6edbbe90ab0890a4e6490f0d35c4d53976bee90175a8331a","bytes":20962}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1860,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1861","source_sha256":"1c29e15fd2b2c123ed907e93c3585a8c9f35e61def11dd35c8045220e20334af","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در جعبه‌ای تعدادی مهره قرار دارد که ۵ تای آن‌ها سیاه است. دو مهره از جعبه خارج می‌کنیم، اگر احتمال این که یک مهرهٔ خارج شده سیاه باشد برابر $\\frac{5}{9}$ باشد، تعداد مهره‌های جعبه چند عدد متمایز می‌تواند باشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۱","aspect_ratio":0.0902}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.9492}],[{"type":"text","text":"۱"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"۲"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"۳"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.9333}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تعداد مهره‌های جعبه را $k$ می‌نامیم.\\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{\\binom{5}{1}\\binom{k-5}{1}}{\\binom{k}{2}} = \\frac{5}{9}$\\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{5 \\times (k-5)}{\\frac{k(k-1)}{2}} = \\frac{5}{9} \\Rightarrow 18(k-5) = k(k-1)$\\n$\\Rightarrow k^2 - 19k + 90 = 0 \\Rightarrow (k-9)(k-10) = 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} k = 9 \\\\ k = 10 \\end{cases}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"d42deca460e61c24abae5af6705655e07d9245e874042d1139f9e2b357234f49","bytes":332},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"983ec5c2fba3a452e1abcb7c0d45d82b76ef52973fa1a1d3e8952624eb3cc21d","bytes":1038},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"75cabc0ce0a5b5024bef2abf1d1838cda4c569d10744ca1ce505a08ca7e11abc","bytes":564},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"e4b7ca9f974a5e5658516859ab892d86652bc8dde94c8d7fb44c402b99d7c319","bytes":1286},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1861/stem_1.webp","sha256":"0789b73e02e72bf94734a70fa27f68f0e275d191d46966ecad5a8bcf32e4e761","bytes":12418}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1861,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":171,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1862","source_sha256":"1d1278b008dac2c6befa131a3c31ad1fd659c2ba21f99db93cb2bad32964a936","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در یک کیسه ۶ مهرهٔ قرمز با شماره‌های ۱ تا ۶ و ۴ مهرهٔ آبی با شماره‌های ۱ تا ۴ موجود است. از این کیسه دو مهره به تصادف خارج می‌کنیم، با کدام احتمال جمع شمارهٔ مهره‌ها برابر ۴ است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۲","aspect_ratio":0.0912}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{7}{45}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{4}{15}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"شمارهٔ مهره‌های قرمز را ۱، ۲، ۳، ۴، ۵ و ۶ و شمارهٔ مهره‌های آبی را ۱'، ۲'، ۳' و ۴' می‌نامیم. اگر پیشامد مورد نظر $A$ باشد، خواهیم داشت:\n$A = \\{ \\underbrace{(1,3)}_{\\text{هر دو قرمز}}, \\underbrace{(1,3'), (2,2'), (3,1')}_{\\text{یکی آبی، یکی قرمز}}, \\underbrace{(1',3')}_{\\text{هر دو آبی}} \\}$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{5}{\\binom{10}{2}} = \\frac{5}{45} = \\frac{1}{9}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"ad06227a0ab9b77b7b80acba6e5eabcc1bfd4cd2d0b4a6d1fa9601e60c5c6df5","bytes":618},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1862/option_2_3.webp","s